penguin-cpp (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release of Penguin cpp, the Linux port of Dev-C++:
    - Editor with syntax colors, code completion, folding and class browser.
    - Single files and projects built with the system's gcc and make.
    - Programs run in a terminal window.
    - Debugger on top of gdb: breakpoints, watches, call stack, step by step.
    - Formatting with astyle and clang-format, printing and PDF export.

 -- Juan Francisco Gonzalez Pacheco <jfgonzalez@unimagdalena.edu.co>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0500
